WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.035
- [Man Voiceover] You are a fraud.

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:04.490
(exciting music)

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:08.376
I have the only super
power that is not a fraud.

00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:10.300
(calm bass music)

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.763
I am here to witness your true worth.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:16.553
This photograph.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:19.883
Is to be your apology.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.463
I am asserting a fairness,

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.083
in an unfair world.

00:00:27.288 --> 00:00:30.743
(energetic music)

00:00:30.743 --> 00:00:31.576
Jessica Jones.

00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:34.822
(energetic music)

00:00:34.822 --> 00:00:36.601
You can't comprehend.

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:37.434
What I am.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:43.115
(jittery Violin string plucking)

00:00:43.115 --> 00:00:46.032
(knocking on door)

00:00:47.145 --> 00:00:48.339
- [Jessica Jones] Who is it?

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.922
(creepy music)

